==========================================================================
READING RULE FOR THE THESIS
==========================================================================
  REPORT the 53-gene interaction set from the PRIMARY model. It is the only
  direct evidence in this project that the RA blood transcriptome differs
  between the sexes, and it must appear in the Results.
  DO NOT report the ComBat count (270) as the headline - it is inflated.
  DO NOT claim the panels are sex-specific on the strength of it: the panels
  and the interaction set are separate analyses answering separate questions.
  DO state that interaction power is ~1/4 of main-effect power, so this is a
  floor on the number of sex-differential genes, not an estimate of it.

